<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="@color/background_light"
    tools:context=".AboutActivity">

    <!-- Header -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/header_layout"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:orientation="horizontal"
        android:gravity="center_vertical"
        android:paddingHorizontal="16dp"
        android:paddingTop="40dp"
        android:paddingBottom="8dp"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent">

        <ImageButton
            android:id="@+id/btn_back"
            android:layout_width="40dp"
            android:layout_height="40dp"
            android:src="@drawable/ic_back"
            android:background="?attr/selectableItemBackgroundBorderless"
            android:contentDescription="Back"
            app:tint="@color/text_primary" />

        <View
            android:layout_width="4dp"
            android:layout_height="28dp"
            android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
            android:background="@color/primary_green" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_weight="1"
            android:layout_marginStart="12dp"
            android:text="About"
            android:textSize="28sp"
            android:textStyle="bold"
            android:textColor="@color/primary_green" />

        <ImageView
            android:layout_width="36dp"
            android:layout_height="36dp"
            android:src="@drawable/logo"
            android:scaleType="centerCrop" />
    </LinearLayout>

    <androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:fillViewport="true"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/header_layout"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="parent">

        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:orientation="vertical"
            android:padding="16dp">

            <!-- ==================== -->
            <!-- SECTION 1: About SPIM -->
            <!-- ==================== -->
            <TextView
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:text="ABOUT SPIM"
                style="@style/SectionHeader"
                android:layout_marginStart="4dp"
                android:layout_marginBottom="8dp" />

            <androidx.cardview.widget.CardView
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="24dp"
                app:cardCornerRadius="16dp"
                app:cardElevation="2dp"
                app:cardBackgroundColor="@color/background_white"
                app:cardUseCompatPadding="true">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:padding="20dp">

                    <!-- App Logo + Name -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:orientation="horizontal"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:layout_marginBottom="16dp">

                        <ImageView
                            android:layout_width="56dp"
                            android:layout_height="56dp"
                            android:src="@drawable/logo"
                            android:scaleType="centerCrop" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:orientation="vertical"
                            android:layout_marginStart="16dp">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="SPIM"
                                android:textSize="22sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/primary_green" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Smart Pest Infestation Monitor"
                                android:textSize="13sp"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_secondary" />

                            <TextView
                                android:id="@+id/tv_about_version"
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Version 1.0"
                                android:textSize="12sp"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                                android:layout_marginTop="2dp" />
                        </LinearLayout>
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider"
                        android:layout_marginBottom="16dp" />

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:text="SPIM is a lightweight, offline-capable mobile application powered by a YOLOv8s TensorFlow Lite model, designed for real-time agricultural pest biosurveillance and detection.\n\nBuilt to support Filipino rice farmers, SPIM enables rapid identification and counting of common rice field pests directly on-device — no internet connection required."
                        android:textSize="14sp"
                        android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                        android:lineSpacingExtra="4dp" />

                </LinearLayout>
            </androidx.cardview.widget.CardView>

            <!-- ======================== -->
            <!-- SECTION 2: Developers   -->
            <!-- ======================== -->
            <TextView
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:text="DEVELOPERS"
                style="@style/SectionHeader"
                android:layout_marginStart="4dp"
                android:layout_marginBottom="8dp" />

            <androidx.cardview.widget.CardView
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="24dp"
                app:cardCornerRadius="16dp"
                app:cardElevation="2dp"
                app:cardBackgroundColor="@color/background_white"
                app:cardUseCompatPadding="true">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:paddingVertical="4dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:text="Undergraduate Researchers"
                        android:textSize="13sp"
                        android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="20dp"
                        android:paddingTop="12dp"
                        android:paddingBottom="4dp" />

                    <!-- Developer 1 -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:minHeight="56dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="16dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="8dp">

                        <FrameLayout
                            android:layout_width="40dp"
                            android:layout_height="40dp">
                            <View
                                android:layout_width="40dp"
                                android:layout_height="40dp"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_icon_circle_green" />
                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                                android:gravity="center"
                                android:text="LB"
                                android:textSize="14sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/primary_green" />
                        </FrameLayout>

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical"
                            android:layout_marginStart="14dp">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Leo Robin L. Binavente"
                                android:textSize="16sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_primary" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Lead Developer"
                                android:textSize="13sp"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_secondary" />
                        </LinearLayout>
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider"
                        android:layout_marginStart="70dp" />

                    <!-- Developer 2 -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:minHeight="56dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="16dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="8dp">

                        <FrameLayout
                            android:layout_width="40dp"
                            android:layout_height="40dp">
                            <View
                                android:layout_width="40dp"
                                android:layout_height="40dp"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_icon_circle_blue" />
                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                                android:gravity="center"
                                android:text="JA"
                                android:textSize="14sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/stat_icon_common" />
                        </FrameLayout>

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical"
                            android:layout_marginStart="14dp">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="John Erivin Apurado"
                                android:textSize="16sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_primary" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Developer"
                                android:textSize="13sp"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_secondary" />
                        </LinearLayout>
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider"
                        android:layout_marginStart="70dp" />

                    <!-- Developer 3 -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:minHeight="56dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="16dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="8dp">

                        <FrameLayout
                            android:layout_width="40dp"
                            android:layout_height="40dp">
                            <View
                                android:layout_width="40dp"
                                android:layout_height="40dp"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_icon_circle_orange" />
                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                                android:gravity="center"
                                android:text="SR"
                                android:textSize="14sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/accent_orange" />
                        </FrameLayout>

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical"
                            android:layout_marginStart="14dp">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Sheryn M. Rasdas"
                                android:textSize="16sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_primary" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="Developer"
                                android:textSize="13sp"
                                android:textColor="@color/text_secondary" />
                        </LinearLayout>
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <!-- Institution -->
                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider" />

                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="20dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="14dp"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical">

                        <ImageView
                            android:layout_width="20dp"
                            android:layout_height="20dp"
                            android:src="@drawable/ic_info"
                            app:tint="@color/text_secondary"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="10dp" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Cavite State University — Naic Campus\nCollege of Engineering and Information Technology"
                            android:textSize="12sp"
                            android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                            android:lineSpacingExtra="2dp" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                </LinearLayout>
            </androidx.cardview.widget.CardView>

            <!-- ================================ -->
            <!-- SECTION 3: Credits & Resources  -->
            <!-- ================================ -->
            <TextView
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:text="CREDITS &amp; RESOURCES"
                style="@style/SectionHeader"
                android:layout_marginStart="4dp"
                android:layout_marginBottom="8dp" />

            <androidx.cardview.widget.CardView
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginBottom="24dp"
                app:cardCornerRadius="16dp"
                app:cardElevation="2dp"
                app:cardBackgroundColor="@color/background_white"
                app:cardUseCompatPadding="true">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:paddingVertical="4dp">

                    <!-- Dataset Credit -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="20dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="14dp"
                        android:orientation="vertical">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Training Dataset"
                            android:textSize="14sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold"
                            android:textColor="@color/primary_green"
                            android:layout_marginBottom="4dp" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="RP11 Dataset — a curated image dataset of common rice pest species, used to train the YOLOv8s detection model for this application."
                            android:textSize="13sp"
                            android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider"
                        android:layout_marginStart="20dp"
                        android:layout_marginEnd="20dp" />

                    <!-- YOLOv8 / Ultralytics -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="20dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="14dp"
                        android:orientation="vertical">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Object Detection Architecture"
                            android:textSize="14sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold"
                            android:textColor="@color/primary_green"
                            android:layout_marginBottom="4dp" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="YOLOv8s by Ultralytics — state-of-the-art real-time object detection architecture. The model was trained and exported to TensorFlow Lite format for efficient on-device inference."
                            android:textSize="13sp"
                            android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider"
                        android:layout_marginStart="20dp"
                        android:layout_marginEnd="20dp" />

                    <!-- Open Source Libraries -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="20dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="14dp"
                        android:orientation="vertical">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Open‑Source Libraries"
                            android:textSize="14sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold"
                            android:textColor="@color/primary_green"
                            android:layout_marginBottom="8dp" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="• TensorFlow Lite — on-device ML inference runtime\n• CameraX — modern Android camera framework\n• Material Components — UI design system\n• OkHttp / Retrofit — network communication\n• MPAndroidChart — data visualization\n• PhotoView — pinch-to-zoom image viewer\n• Firebase Cloud Messaging — push notifications"
                            android:textSize="13sp"
                            android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                            android:lineSpacingExtra="5dp" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <View
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="1dp"
                        android:background="@color/divider"
                        android:layout_marginStart="20dp"
                        android:layout_marginEnd="20dp" />

                    <!-- Pest Information Sources -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:paddingHorizontal="20dp"
                        android:paddingVertical="14dp"
                        android:orientation="vertical">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="Pest Information Sources"
                            android:textSize="14sp"
                            android:textStyle="bold"
                            android:textColor="@color/primary_green"
                            android:layout_marginBottom="8dp" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="• IRRI Rice Knowledge Bank. International Rice Research Institute (IRRI), Los Baños, Philippines. Pest management fact sheets covering stem borers, planthoppers, leafhoppers, golden apple snails, black bugs, rice hispa, skippers, and rice bugs.\n\n• Pinoy Rice Knowledge Bank (PhilRice &amp; DA). Philippine Rice Research Institute and the Department of Agriculture, Philippines. Pest management guides including stem borer management, rice black bug ecology, and golden apple snail control.\n\n• CABI Compendium (PlantWise Plus Knowledge Bank). Centre for Agriculture and Bioscience International. Species datasheets for Dicladispa armigera (rice hispa), Leptocorisa oratorius (slender rice bug), Scirpophaga incertulas (yellow stem borer), and related rice pests.\n\n• Jahn, G.C., Domingo, I., Liberty, M., Almazan, P., &amp; Pacia, J. (2004). Effect of rice bug Leptocorisa oratorius (Hemiptera: Alydidae) on rice yield, grain quality, and seed viability.\n\n• Litsinger, J.A., Barrion, A.T., Canapi, B.L., et al. (2015). Leptocorisa rice seed bugs (Hemiptera: Alydidae) in Asia: A review. Philippine Journal of Science.\n\n• Heong, K.L., &amp; Hardy, B. (Eds.). (2009). Planthoppers: New threats to the sustainability of intensive rice production systems in Asia.\n\n• Savary, S., Willocquet, L., Elazegui, F.A., Castilla, N.P., &amp; Teng, P.S. (2000). Rice pest constraints in tropical Asia: quantification of yield losses due to rice pests in a range of production situations.\n\n• Cabauatan, P.Q., Cabunagan, R.C., &amp; Choi, I.R. (2009). Rice viruses transmitted by the brown planthopper Nilaparvata lugens Stāl.\n\n• Joshi, R.C., Sebastian, L.S., &amp; IRRI. (2006). Global advances in ecology and management of golden apple snails.\n\n• Hadi, B.A.R., &amp; Villareal, S.C. (n.d.). Aspects of the ecology of rice black bug (Scotinophara coarctata Fabricius) at IRRI.\n\n• Lucid Central / PPPW (Pacific Pests, Pathogens and Weeds). Fact sheets for rice striped stem borer, rice yellow stem borer, and related species.\n\n• Heinrichs, E.A. (Ed.). (1994). Biology and Management of Rice Insects.\n\n• Litsinger, J.A. (2011). Cultural practices mitigate irrigated rice insect pest losses in the Philippines.\n\n• Reissig, W.H., Heinrichs, E.A., Litsinger, J.A., Moody, K., Fiedler, L., Mew, T.W., &amp; Barrion, A.T. (1986). Illustrated Guide to Integrated Pest Management in Rice in Tropical Asia.\n\n• Lim, G.S., &amp; Heong, K.L. (1984). The role of insecticides in the population dynamics of rice insect pests."
                            android:textSize="13sp"
                            android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                </LinearLayout>
            </androidx.cardview.widget.CardView>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <TextView
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:text="© 2025 CvSU — Naic Campus. All rights reserved."
                android:textSize="12sp"
                android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
                android:gravity="center"
                android:layout_marginBottom="32dp" />

        </LinearLayout>
    </androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView>

</androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>
